Z||000013||Fformula88||07-04-2001||05:18 PM||||I am sure Cliff would have certain members in mind if he wants to add moderators to this board.  There are some long time members on this board who are great people and would do a wonderful job as moderator.<P>However, I think one of the great things about this board is the lack of moderators.  Moderators on other boards often end up on power trips and feel they are better than everyone else.  It ends up creating a class system that divides the board, which IMO deminishes from the boards value and fun.  As logn as people try to keep themselves in line most of the time, we won't need lots of big brothers sifting thru posts looking for offensive stuff.<P>------------------<BR>John  <BR>AOLIM: Fformula88<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierosig2.JPG"> <BR>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1985 Fiero SE 2M6||||reg||1
